-- Two renderings that claim the SAME language are still ambiguous, and the
-- diagnostic says which language. Distinct tags on one name are fine and
-- attach both; that case is not a failure and so is not witnessed here.
--
-- The bare `[...]` form cannot carry a tag, so this uses the heralded form.
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is large` @nlg:he one rendering
                  @nlg:he another rendering
  IF amount GREATER THAN 100
